==Battleground==
*1 [[Scissoroo]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*2 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 15.33 seconds<sup>460f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Wild Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**5 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
**5 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 28 seconds<sup>840f</sup>.
**1 [[Casaurian Ahirujo]] spawns.
**1 [[Casaurian Ahirujo]] spawns after 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>.
**1 [[Crustaceous Scissorex]] spawns.

==Strategy==
While this stage may appear threatening, [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] will obliterate Casaurian Ahirujo, and then chip Crustaceous Scissorex. Bring a few meatshields and maybe a Research [[Cat Combo]].

